{"n":11,"title":"It's 7:30 somewhere","blurb":"Называть время","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"It's 7:30 somewhere","sub":"","html":"<p>Как называть время — фильмы, встречи и следующий поезд.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Называть время</li><li>Говорить о частях дня</li><li>Спрашивать What time is it?</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Когда вы заняты? Выберите.","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"morning"},{"label":"afternoon"},{"label":"evening"},{"label":"night"},{"label":"weekend"},{"label":"never"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"time","pos":"","ru":"время","kk":"уақыт","def":"What's the time?","img":"/course/a0/img/l11-time.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/714eea0f4c98.mp3"},{"en":"o'clock","pos":"","ru":"часов (ровно)","kk":"сағат (дәл)","def":"It's one o'clock.","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"half","pos":"","ru":"половина","kk":"жарты","def":"It's half past seven.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/6dbdd59ab542.mp3"},{"en":"quarter","pos":"","ru":"четверть","kk":"ширек","def":"It's a quarter past four.","img":"/course/a0/img/l11-quarter.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/7fa1f94325c1.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"note","title":"Два способа назвать время","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Часы</th><th>Обычно</th><th>Полнее</th></tr><tr><td>1:00</td><td>It's one o'clock.</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>4:15</td><td>It's four fifteen.</td><td>It's a quarter past four.</td></tr><tr><td>7:30</td><td>It's seven thirty.</td><td>It's half past seven.</td></tr><tr><td>9:45</td><td>It's nine forty-five.</td><td>It's a quarter to ten.</td></tr></table><p>Простой способ: сначала час, потом минуты — <b>four fifteen</b>.</p><p>Ровно в час: <b>o'clock</b>. С минутами не говорят.</p><p><b>past</b> — после часа, <b>to</b> — до следующего часа.</p>"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите время.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/52c0a7cb37ad.mp3","prompt":"","options":["11:50","11:15","11:05"],"answer":"11:15","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите время.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/0c6c046467bb.mp3","prompt":"","options":["1:13","1:30","1:03"],"answer":"1:30","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Запишите время.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/531d8c31e1e6.mp3","before":"It's","after":".","answers":["9:45"],"bank":["9:45","9:15","10:45"]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите время.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/defaafd6dd05.mp3","prompt":"","options":["7:33","7:23","6:33"],"answer":"7:33","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"morning","pos":"","ru":"утро","kk":"таң","def":"I start work in the morning.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/45a21e4b5b2a.mp3"},{"en":"afternoon","pos":"","ru":"день","kk":"түстен кейін","def":"In the afternoon I'm at the office.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/7a10f399752f.mp3"},{"en":"evening","pos":"","ru":"вечер","kk":"кеш","def":"In the evening I'm at home.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/d57fd91679ff.mp3"},{"en":"night","pos":"","ru":"ночь","kk":"түн","def":"At night I sleep.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/1be2a44cb53d.mp3"},{"en":"midday","pos":"","ru":"полдень","kk":"түс","def":"Lunch is at midday.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/8dc90b4f3f6c.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cols","title":"in или at?","sub":"","columns":["in the…","at…"],"items":[{"text":"evening","col":0},{"text":"afternoon","col":0},{"text":"midday","col":1},{"text":"night","col":1},{"text":"morning","col":0},{"text":"3 o'clock","col":1}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"В одном — время по часам, в другом — часть дня.","items":[{"text":"The film is at seven thirty.","src":null},{"text":"I work in the morning.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"at / in","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Слово</th><th>С чем</th><th>Пример</th></tr><tr><td>at</td><td>clock times</td><td>The train is at ten forty-two.</td></tr><tr><td>at</td><td>night</td><td>At night I sleep.</td></tr><tr><td>in</td><td>the morning / afternoon / evening</td><td>In the evening I'm at home.</td></tr></table><p>Время по часам → <b>at</b>: at 3 o'clock, at seven thirty.</p><p>Часть дня → <b>in the</b>: in the morning.</p><p><b>Night</b> — исключение: <b>at night</b>, а не «in the night».</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">on + дни и in + месяцы будут в уроке 12.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["What time is it?","It's seven thirty.","The film is at seven thirty.","I start work at seven o'clock.","In the morning I have breakfast.","At night I sleep."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"The meeting is ___ two o'clock.","options":["in","at","on"],"keep":false,"answer":"at","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"I work ___ the morning.","options":["at","on","in"],"keep":false,"answer":"in","why":"Часть дня → in the.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ night I sleep.","options":["At","In","On"],"keep":false,"answer":"At","why":"С night всегда at.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"It's 7:30. It's seven","after":".","answers":["thirty"],"bank":["thirty","o'clock","thirteen"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"It's 4:15. It's a quarter","after":"four.","answers":["past"],"bank":["at","to","past"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"The film is","after":"nine o'clock.","answers":["at"],"bank":["at","in","on"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"match","title":"Соедините время и слова.","sub":"","pairs":[{"left":"1:00","right":"one o'clock"},{"left":"4:15","right":"a quarter past four"},{"left":"7:30","right":"half past seven"},{"left":"9:45","right":"a quarter to ten"}],"options":["a quarter to ten","half past seven","a quarter past four","one o'clock"]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["the","film?","time","is","What"],"answer":"What time is the film?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["seven.","at","I","start","work"],"answer":"I start work at seven.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["I","In","home.","am","at","the","evening"],"answer":"In the evening I am at home.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["The","train","is","in","ten","forty-two."],"bad":3,"answer":"The train is at ten forty-two.","why":"Время по часам → at."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","sleep","in","the","night."],"bad":2,"answer":"I sleep at night.","why":"С night — at и без the."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["It's","seven","thirty","o'clock."],"bad":3,"answer":"It's seven thirty.","why":"o'clock — только для ровного часа."},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/97434883917a.mp3","prompt":"— What time is it?","options":["It's one o'clock.","It's two o'clock.","It's one fifteen."],"answer":"It's one o'clock.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/2f7be0895e4d.mp3","prompt":"— What time is it?","options":["It's three ten.","It's two ten.","It's three nine."],"answer":"It's three ten.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Запишите время.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/ec762a180222.mp3","before":"It's","after":".","answers":["7:30"],"bank":["7:30","6:30","7:13"]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/27ef6b2acb74.mp3","prompt":"— What time is it?","options":["12:15","12:55","11:55"],"answer":"12:55","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/823fa3769426.mp3","prompt":"Во сколько фильм?","options":["at seven thirteen","at seven thirty","at seven o'clock"],"answer":"at seven thirty","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/92b05a9f8b60.mp3","prompt":"Когда встреча?","options":["from two to four","from four to two","at two thirty"],"answer":"from two to four","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/47c8f3cbfa48.mp3","before":"The next train is at","after":".","answers":["10:42"],"bank":["10:42","10:24","2:42"]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Аиду.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Aida</p><p>Hi! I'm Aida. I'm a nurse in Almaty.</p><p>I start work at seven o'clock in the morning.</p><p>I have lunch at half past twelve.</p><p>In the evening I'm at home. At night I sleep — usually!</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Aida starts work at seven.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Aida</p><p>Hi! I'm Aida. I'm a nurse in Almaty.</p><p>I start work at seven o'clock in the morning.</p><p>I have lunch at half past twelve.</p><p>In the evening I'm at home. At night I sleep — usually!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Aida has lunch in the evening.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Aida</p><p>Hi! I'm Aida. I'm a nurse in Almaty.</p><p>I start work at seven o'clock in the morning.</p><p>I have lunch at half past twelve.</p><p>In the evening I'm at home. At night I sleep — usually!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"night she sleeps.","answers":["At"],"bank":["At","On","In"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Aida</p><p>Hi! I'm Aida. I'm a nurse in Almaty.</p><p>I start work at seven o'clock in the morning.</p><p>I have lunch at half past twelve.</p><p>In the evening I'm at home. At night I sleep — usually!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите о своём дне.","sub":"Одно время по часам и одна часть дня.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>I start work at ___ .</li><li>In the ___ I ___ .</li><li>At night I ___ .</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">at</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">in the</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">seven o'clock</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">half past eight</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">morning</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">evening</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">night</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I sleep</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I'm at home</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>Перед временем по часам стоит <b>at</b>.</li><li>Перед частями дня — <b>in the</b>.</li><li>Я написал(а) <b>at night</b>, а не «in the night».</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Сначала послушайте каждое предложение.","items":["What time is it?","It's half past seven.","The film is at seven thirty.","In the morning I have breakfast."]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 11 пройден","sub":"Урок 11 из 24 · Юнит 3 пройден","items":["Я могу назвать время.","Я могу говорить о частях дня.","Я могу спросить и ответить What time is it?"]}]}
